        "name" : "Limit",
        "description" : "Determines which indices are passed to the output. The first index is zero.\n\nThe format is the following: [range];[range];... with [range] either being a single integer or a range [from]-[to] (both inclusive). Negative values must be enclosed in parentheses. Example: 0-5;1;(-1)-10. If you want more customization options use the expression mode and functions such as MAKE_SEQUENCE."
